# Implementation plan — Spec 1.9.2

## Summary

Spec 1.9.2 adds a reusable **`Pagination`** component to `@webonone/ui-kit` with first/previous/next/last controls, numbered pages with ellipsis, “Showing X–Y of Z” summary, and optional page-size selection. Showcase demo on Controls tab; **Email History** replaces inline prev/next as the reference consumer. See [01-overview.md](./01-overview.md), [02-ui-kit-pagination.md](./02-ui-kit-pagination.md).

## Branch and prerequisites

| Item | Value |
|------|--------|
| Branch | `spec/1.9.2` |
| Package builds | `npm run build -w @webonone/ui-kit` before email prod build |
| Vite alias | Email aliases ui-kit to `src/` in dev |

