## Risks and open items

- Ellipsis window logic must handle `totalPages` of 1–2 without duplicate buttons.
- Email History currently uses fixed `pageSize: 20` — consider adding 20 to `pageSizeOptions` or default options `[10, 20, 25, 50]`.
- Other services (WebOnOne lists) can adopt `Pagination` in a follow-up spec.

